<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Criar conta | SØLID</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/css/style.css?v=stable-navigation-22"></head>
<body><main class="account-page"><div class="container"><section class="account-card account-card-wide"><h1>Criar conta</h1><p>Cadastre seus dados para comprar com mais praticidade e acompanhar seus favoritos.</p><!-- Google temporariamente oculto: <a class="google-login-button" href="../api/google.php" data-google-login><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#4285F4" d="M43.6 24.5c0-1.4-.1-2.8-.4-4.1H24v7.8h11a9.4 9.4 0 0 1-4.1 6.2v5h6.6c3.9-3.6 6.1-8.8 6.1-14.9Z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M24 44c5.5 0 10.1-1.8 13.5-4.9l-6.6-5c-1.8 1.2-4.1 1.9-6.9 1.9-5.3 0-9.9-3.6-11.5-8.4H5.7v5.2A20.4 20.4 0 0 0 24 44Z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M12.5 27.6a12 12 0 0 1 0-7.2v-5.2H5.7a20 20 0 0 0 0 17.6l6.8-5.2Z"/><path fill="#EA4335" d="M24 12c3 0 5.6 1 7.7 3l5.8-5.8A19.4 19.4 0 0 0 24 4 20.4 20.4 0 0 0 5.7 15.2l6.8 5.2C14.1 15.6 18.7 12 24 12Z"/></svg><span>Sign in with Google</span></a><div class="account-divider"><span>ou use seu e-mail</span></div> --><form id="register-form" class="account-form"><div class="account-form-grid"><label>Nome completo<input id="register-name" maxlength="50" type="text" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="Seu nome"></label><label>WhatsApp<input id="register-phone" data-phone type="tel" required inputmode="numeric" maxlength="15" placeholder="(00) 00000-0000"></label><label class="account-full">E-mail<input id="register-email" maxlength="50" type="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="nome@exemplo.com"></label><label>Senha<input id="register-password" maxlength="50" type="password" required minlength="6" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Mínimo de 6 caracteres"></label><label>CPF <small>(opcional)</small><input id="register-cpf" data-cpf maxlength="14" type="text" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="000.000.000-00"></label><label>CEP<input id="register-zip" data-zip type="text" required inputmode="numeric" maxlength="9" placeholder="00000-000"></label><label class="account-full">Rua / Avenida<input id="register-address" maxlength="50" type="text" required></label><label>Número<input id="register-number" maxlength="50" type="text" required></label><label>Complemento <small>(opcional)</small><input id="register-complement" maxlength="50" type="text"></label><label>Bairro<input id="register-neighborhood" maxlength="50" type="text" required></label><label>Cidade / UF<input id="register-city" maxlength="50" type="text" required placeholder="Ex.: Belo Horizonte / MG"></label><label class="account-full">Foto de perfil <small>(opcional)</small><input id="register-image" type="file" accept="image/*"></label></div><label class="newsletter-choice"><input id="register-newsletter" type="checkbox"> Quero receber lançamentos, promoções e novidades por e-mail.</label><p id="account-message" class="account-message" role="alert"></p><button class="btn-primary" type="submit">Criar minha conta</button></form><p class="account-alternative">Já possui uma conta? <a href="login.php">Entrar</a></p></section></div></main><script src="../assets/js/account.js?v=profile-viewer-7"></script><script src="../assets/js/address-lookup.js"></script><script src="../assets/js/main.js?v=page-mist-20"></script><script src="../assets/js/footer.js"></script></body></html>
